  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "abc_fold_box_v21",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tABC fold_the_paper_box \u2014 LeRobot v2.1\n\t\n\nA LeRobot v2.1 conversion of the fold_the_paper_box task from\nXDOF/ABC-130k, prepared for\nfine-tuning pi0.5 (pi05_base)\non the bimanual YAM platform.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tContents\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nAttribute\nValue\n\n\n\t\t\nEpisodes\n500 (first 500 of 2,387 train episodes, sorted by episode uuid)\n\n\nFrames\n2,260,990 (~21 hours)\n\n\nFPS\n30\n\n\nRobot\nBimanual station, 2\u00d7 6-DoF YAM arms, parallel-jaw grippers\n\n\nCameras\nhead_camera, left_wrist_camera, right_wrist_camera \u2014\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Sichang0621/abc_fold_box_v21.",
  "alternateName": [
    "Sichang0621/abc_fold_box_v21",
    "ABC fold_the_paper_box (LeRobot v2.1)"
  ],
